            </p>
            <div class="about-points">
                <div class="about-point"><span class="bi bi-check-circle-fill" aria-hidden="true"></span> Residential &amp; commercial cleaning</div>
                <div class="about-point"><span class="bi bi-check-circle-fill" aria-hidden="true"></span> All work guaranteed, bonded &amp; insured</div>
                <div class="about-point"><span class="bi bi-check-circle-fill" aria-hidden="true"></span> Zero-contact service options available</div>
                <div class="about-point"><span class="bi bi-check-circle-fill" aria-hidden="true"></span> Natural, organic green cleaning on request</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-stats">
            <div class="stat-card">
